service; production or operation of a substantially identical app with
only cosmetic/design changes; and extraction or reverse engineering of
the data or algorithms.

This work contains fingerprints, canary data, and watermarks for
authorship identification. Unauthorized copying can be proven on that
basis, and the original authorship date is evidenced by this
